    {
      "id": "ANODEBURN",
      "x": 372,
      "y": 122,
      "label": "Anode off-gas burner",
      "label_ko": "Anode off-gas 연소기",
      "active_when": {
        "S5": [
          "ANODEBURN"
        ]
      },
      "rationale": "The reformer needs 15-20 percent of feed LHV, and at 60-80 percent fuel utilisation a fifth to two fifths of the hydrogen leaves the anode unburned. Burning it supplies that duty. It is structurally distinct from taking stack exhaust heat: combustion reaches a higher temperature and decouples the reformer from the stack temperature."
