        "S2": [
          "PARTIAL",
          "FULL"
        ]
      },
      "rationale": "Not the cycle condenser. This knocks steam out of methanol or glycerol reformate so a purifier or a low temperature cell can take the gas: a different stream, pressure and purpose."
    },
